## NOT DONE — deliberately: migrations are NOT applied

The three files under supabase/migrations/20260913000*_vtid_03832_* are in this PR only. Applying them is a
production schema change on the single Supabase project and needs the platform owner's explicit "apply now"
in-conversation (execution brief rule 4). Consequently the staging verification step (grant `backoffice` to the
documented test user, switch into it, revert) is also NOT done — it cannot succeed before the enum exists.

